\begin{tabular}{@{}p{3.6cm}p{10.4cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{Term} & \textbf{Meaning} \\
\midrule
Business ethics & Moral principles that guide conduct in commercial activities. \\
Social responsibility & Obligations of a firm to contribute positively to society beyond profit. \\
Global management & Coordination of organisational activities across different countries. \\
Cultural differences & Variations in values, norms, and behaviours among societies that affect business. \\
Ethical decision‑making framework & Structured process for analysing and resolving moral dilemmas. \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
